# ClassicGuide - Tanaris (41-45), both factions
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide Both_Tanaris
@name Tanaris (Gadgetzan)
@faction Both
@levels 41-44
@zone Tanaris
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Gadgetzan's neutral quest hub: the Wastewander bandits, the water survey, the pirates of Lost Rigger Cove and Steamwheedle Port. Zul'Farrak (dungeon) quests are optional.
@next A_Feralas [faction=Alliance]
@next H_Feralas [faction=Horde]

fp Gadgetzan
bind Gadgetzan [area=976]
accept Gadgetzan Water Survey | Senior Surveyor Fizzledowser.
accept WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting [elite; group=3; optional]
accept 2865 Scarab Shells [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
complete WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting [elite; group=3; optional] | Caliph Scorpidsting's Head drops from Caliph Scorpidsting.
turnin WANTED: Caliph Scorpidsting [optional]
accept 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
accept Wastewander Justice | Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle, Gadgetzan.
accept Water Pouch Bounty | Spigot Operator Luglunket.
complete Wastewander Justice | Wastewander bandits east of Gadgetzan.
complete Water Pouch Bounty | Same bandits drop Wastewander Water Pouches.
turnin Water Pouch Bounty
complete Gadgetzan Water Survey | Use the tool at the Noxious Lair water hole.
turnin Wastewander Justice
accept More Wastewander Justice
complete More Wastewander Justice
turnin More Wastewander Justice
turnin Gadgetzan Water Survey
accept Noxious Lair Investigation
complete Noxious Lair Investigation | Centipaar insects at the Noxious Lair.
turnin Noxious Lair Investigation
accept The Scrimshank Redemption
complete The Scrimshank Redemption | Inside the Noxious Lair tunnels.
turnin The Scrimshank Redemption
accept 110 Insect Part Analysis
turnin 110 Insect Part Analysis | Alchemist Pestlezugg.
accept 113 Insect Part Analysis
turnin 113 Insect Part Analysis
accept Pirate Hats Ahoy! | Haughty Modiste.
accept WANTED: Andre Firebeard | The wanted poster in Gadgetzan. Turned in at Steamwheedle Port.
accept Southsea Shakedown | Security Chief Bilgewhizzle at Steamwheedle Port.
accept 2873 Stoley's Shipment
complete Southsea Shakedown | Pirates at Lost Rigger Cove.
complete WANTED: Andre Firebeard | Andre Firebeard at Lost Rigger Cove, in the pirate camp on the coast.
complete Pirate Hats Ahoy! | Southsea Pirate Hat drops from Southsea Dock Worker, Southsea Freebooter and Southsea Pirate and others.
turnin Southsea Shakedown
turnin WANTED: Andre Firebeard | Security Chief Bilgewhizzle, Steamwheedle Port.
turnin Pirate Hats Ahoy!
grind 43 Fire Roc, Scorpid Tail Lasher | Gahz'ridian needs level 43: kill these nearby until you reach it.
accept Gahz'ridian [optional] | Marvon Rivetseeker, south of Gadgetzan. Needs level 43.
note The next quest, Tooga's Quest, is an escort: pick it up only when you are ready to follow the NPC.
accept 1560 Tooga's Quest
complete 1560 Tooga's Quest | Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
complete 2873 Stoley's Shipment
complete Gahz'ridian [optional] | Wear the Gahz'ridian Detector helmet he gives you and dig up Gahz'ridian Ornaments in the Gahz'ridian ruins, south-west.
turnin Gahz'ridian [optional]
accept The Thirsty Goblin [optional] | Marin Noggenfogger, Gadgetzan. Needs level 44.
accept 3042 Troll Temper [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
turnin 2873 Stoley's Shipment
turnin 1560 Tooga's Quest
complete The Thirsty Goblin [optional] | Laden Dew Glands from Thistleshrub Dew Collectors in the south-west of Tanaris.
turnin The Thirsty Goblin [optional]
complete 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
complete 2865 Scarab Shells [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
complete 3042 Troll Temper [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
turnin 2768 Divino-matic Rod [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
turnin 2865 Scarab Shells [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
turnin 3042 Troll Temper [dungeon=Zul'Farrak]
level 44
train
note Alliance: fly to Thalanaar or take the boat to Feathermoon Stronghold. Horde: fly to Camp Mojache in Feralas.
